Package: hulk
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, golang
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/grafov/hulk
Description: Web server DoS testing tool (Golang port)
 HULK is a web server denial-of-service tool that generates volumes
 of unique and obfuscated traffic, bypassing caching engines and
 hitting the server’s direct resource pool. This version is ported
 to Go from the original Python utility.
